(text "USB 3.0 Micro-B, Hirose ZX360D-B-10P. PROVISIONAL: connector choice open (docs/design.md); swap\nusb_micro_b() in tools/gen_sch.py. SS TX AC-coupled with 100 nF, ESD on the receptacle side of the\ncaps. Pairs wired P to P; AN70707 p.22 allows a P/N swap on SS RX if the layout wants it. ID open\n(device). Shell to GND through 100k || 2.2 nF (AN70707 Figure 35). VBUS only reaches the FX3's VBUS\ndetect." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "22890a5a-f458-43c0-b8db-f719c516960c"))
